This is an unofficial fan-made support tool for the tabletop RPG
"Shinobigami" (シノビガミ / 忍神). "シノビガミ" is a copyrighted work of
Bouken Kikakukyoku (冒険企画局) and Toichiro Kawashima (河嶋陶一朗).
This repository contains no rulebook text, no scenario text, and no
official artwork; users must legally own the original game materials.
This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the
rights holders, and it follows the joint "TRPG二次創作活動ガイドライン"
(https://arclight.co.jp/trpg-rights/). The MIT license above applies only
to the original code and original content in this repository.
